<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Gradient Shaping Beyond Clipping: 
<br class="ltx_break">A Functional Perspective on Update Magnitude Control<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span><sup id="id8" class="ltx_sup">†</sup>Corresponding author.</span></span></span></h1>
